  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Miroku is a female student whose grandfather has entrusted her with the job of an antique dealer, due to her keen eye for appraisal. Today, a female student comes to visit with her face wrapped in bandages. The owner of the storehouse, which holds many antiques, has been cursed with an unknown illness, and so has his entire family. This is a work by Tanimura Yumeji that depicts the mysterious events that occur to the young girl."
  },
